```

- `CLIENT_ID` – found in the Discord Developer Portal under your bot’s “General Information”.
- `GUILD_ID` – if set, commands are registered only for that guild (instant updates). Omit or leave blank to register globally (may take up to an hour).
- `AUDIT_LOG_CHANNEL_ID` – the channel where the forensic ban embed will be posted.

